------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)  (cost=3.56..5.03 rows=21 width=12) (actual time=1.295..1.334 rows=20 loops=1)
   ->  Finalize HashAggregate  (cost=3.56..3.63 rows=7 width=12) (actual time=1.164..1.165 rows=7 loops=1)
         Group Key: d
         ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)  (cost=1.50..3.47 rows=18 width=12) (actual time=1.138..1.160 rows=7 loops=1)
               Hash Key: d
               ->  Partial HashAggregate  (cost=1.50..1.68 rows=18 width=12) (actual time=0.026..0.028 rows=10 loops=1)
                     Group Key: d
                     ->  Seq Scan on smallt  (cost=0.00..1.33 rows=33 width=4) (actual time=0.008..0.012 rows=50 loops=1)
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
 Planning Time: 0.253 ms
   (slice0)    Executor memory: 115K bytes.
   (slice1)    Executor memory: 20K bytes avg x 3 workers, 20K bytes max (seg1).  Work_mem: 24K bytes max.
   (slice2)    Executor memory: 112K bytes avg x 3 workers, 112K bytes max (seg0).  Work_mem: 24K bytes max.
 Memory used:  128000kB
 Execution Time: 1.916 ms
(15 rows)

